{"id":"b346119a43f2e4c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-logic-formula-set.md","title":"ZFC Logic Formula Set","display":"df-zfc-logic-formula-set — ZFC Logic Formula Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-formula-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-formula-set"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-formula-set — ZFC Logic Formula Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-formula-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-formula-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-formula-set — ZFC Logic Formula Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"58-df-language\">58-df-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,F,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V\">\\(L,F,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"58-df-language\">58-df-language</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (formula-code constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicFormulaSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicFormulaSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}formula\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicFormulaSet}_S(F,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Language}_S(L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)\\land F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a\\upharpoonright\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a\\upharpoonright\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}formula\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicFormulaSet}_S(F,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Language}_S(L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)\\land F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a\\upharpoonright\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a\\upharpoonright\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The language tuple is translated to the exact five-component signature consumed by the formula constructor; no second, incompatible closure system is introduced.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-language]]) and $\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ (formula-code constructor, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-language]]) and $\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ (formula-code constructor, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,F,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicFormulaSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}formula\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicFormulaSet}_S(F,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Language}_S(L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)\\land F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a\\upharpoonright\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a\\upharpoonright\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1330,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2474","lo